+
+<div class="policy-note">
+This Privacy Policy is published in accordance with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act) and the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025, and the Information Technology Act, 2000 read with the Information Technology (Reasonable Security Practices and Procedures and Sensitive Personal Data or Information) Rules, 2011, as applicable to Silverline Techno Solutions as a Data Fiduciary under Indian law.
